      "start_ms": 422340,
      "end_ms": 425460,
      "text": "但是是围绕着这个生活服务的一些劳动团体啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 137,
      "start_ms": 426580,
      "end_ms": 429140,
      "text": "嗯比如说志愿者代表"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 138,
      "start_ms": 431740,
      "end_ms": 434100,
      "text": "啊这个是一般的在地会员"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 139,
      "start_ms": 434100,
      "end_ms": 438220,
      "text": "然后这边的30%呢是远程会员"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 140,
      "start_ms": 441460,
      "end_ms": 443260,
      "text": "啊远程会员"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 141,
      "start_ms": 443260,
      "end_ms": 447020,
      "text": "那么这样形成一个比较有代表性的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 142,
      "start_ms": 447020,
      "end_ms": 449100,
      "text": "我们把它叫做"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 143,
      "start_ms": 450060,
      "end_ms": 451380,
      "text": "生活委员会啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 144,
      "start_ms": 453060,
      "end_ms": 455020,
      "text": "生活服务委员会啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 145,
      "start_ms": 457980,
      "end_ms": 463000,
      "text": "或者说什么什么会员自我管理的一个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 146,
      "start_ms": 463000,
      "end_ms": 465540,
      "text": "那么这个他的管理啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 147,
      "start_ms": 465540,
      "end_ms": 471910,
      "text": "主要就是说啊协商协调一些啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 148,
      "start_ms": 471910,
      "end_ms": 473970,
      "text": "重大事故啊啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 149,
      "start_ms": 473970,
      "end_ms": 476990,
      "text": "但是说他并不是完全具有绝对的决策权的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 150,
      "start_ms": 476990,
      "end_ms": 480250,
      "text": "那么我们我们建议是这个343的这个关系啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 151,
      "start_ms": 480250,
      "end_ms": 481640,
      "text": "343的关系"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 152,
      "start_ms": 481640,
      "end_ms": 483880,
      "text": "你总不能说这个东西要要决策"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 153,
      "start_ms": 483880,
      "end_ms": 484920,
      "text": "是把这个店卖掉"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 154,
      "start_ms": 484920,
      "end_ms": 485680,
      "text": "那不行的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 155,
      "start_ms": 485680,
      "end_ms": 487640,
      "text": "就特别重大是不行的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 156,
      "start_ms": 487640,
      "end_ms": 489789,
      "text": "但是比较重大的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 157,
      "start_ms": 489789,
      "end_ms": 492549,
      "text": "比如说哪些人这个氛围不符合"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 158,
      "start_ms": 492549,
      "end_ms": 493449,
      "text": "要把他踢掉"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 159,
      "start_ms": 493449,
      "end_ms": 496660,
      "text": "就说给不给他办会员啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 160,
      "start_ms": 496660,
      "end_ms": 498640,
      "text": "这个还有哦"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 161,
      "start_ms": 498640,
      "end_ms": 501540,
      "text": "还有就是这个343还有决决"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 162,
      "start_ms": 501540,
      "end_ms": 503580,
      "text": "决决策一个特别重要的一个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 163,
      "start_ms": 503580,
      "end_ms": 507020,
      "text": "就是说我们的福利兜底"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 164,
      "start_ms": 508440,
      "end_ms": 510960,
      "text": "福利兜底的一些一个保障啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 165,
      "start_ms": 510960,
      "end_ms": 513580,
      "text": "我们就结合就是反正在这里讲"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 166,
      "start_ms": 513580,
      "end_ms": 518669,
      "text": "他就有一个啊众人意见汇总啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 167,
      "start_ms": 521960,
      "end_ms": 525020,
      "text": "然后结合刚刚我们说的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 168,
      "start_ms": 525020,
      "end_ms": 526940,
      "text": "结合刚刚我们说的这个远程会员啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 169,
      "start_ms": 526940,
      "end_ms": 527960,
      "text": "远程会员的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 170,
      "start_ms": 527960,
      "end_ms": 533569,
      "text": "他的这个1/3时长的一个这个沉淀啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 171,
      "start_ms": 533569,
      "end_ms": 536709,
      "text": "结合远程会员1/3时长沉淀的这个机制"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 172,
      "start_ms": 536709,
      "end_ms": 540920,
      "text": "那么这1/3时长沉淀下来嗯"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 173,
      "start_ms": 542320,
      "end_ms": 552540,
      "text": "就是远程会员可以把自己沉淀的时长啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 174,
      "start_ms": 552540,
      "end_ms": 555980,
      "text": "交托给一个福利兜底的池子"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 175,
      "start_ms": 557420,
      "end_ms": 559440,
      "text": "可以去帮别人啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 176,
      "start_ms": 559440,
      "end_ms": 563900,
      "text": "可以去帮助这个生活失能的人啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 177,
      "start_ms": 563900,
      "end_ms": 565849,
      "text": "帮助失能者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 178,
      "start_ms": 566089,
      "end_ms": 568149,
      "text": "那么哪些人呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 179,
      "start_ms": 568149,
      "end_ms": 569989,
      "text": "关键是哪些人呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 180,
      "start_ms": 569989,
      "end_ms": 571469,
      "text": "哪些是失能呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 181,
      "start_ms": 571469,
      "end_ms": 572549,
      "text": "怎么推举"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 182,
      "start_ms": 572549,
      "end_ms": 573369,
      "text": "怎么来判民"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 183,
      "start_ms": 573369,
      "end_ms": 574880,
      "text": "这些人是不行啦"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 184,
      "start_ms": 574880,
      "end_ms": 578590,
      "text": "那么是由这个生活委员会来推举出来的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 185,
      "start_ms": 578590,
      "end_ms": 580990,
      "text": "他会推举出哪些人失能者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 186,
      "start_ms": 580990,
      "end_ms": 583190,
      "text": "然后是可以把远程会员"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 187,
      "start_ms": 583190,
      "end_ms": 584070,
      "text": "他愿意啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 188,
      "start_ms": 584070,
      "end_ms": 584990,
      "text": "我们说啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 189,
      "start_ms": 584990,
      "end_ms": 586300,
      "text": "我已经有社保了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 190,
      "start_ms": 586300,
      "end_ms": 587820,
      "text": "我不知道这个东西给我什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 191,
      "start_ms": 587820,
      "end_ms": 590300,
      "text": "老了之后什么吃口大锅饭做保障"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 192,
      "start_ms": 590300,
      "end_ms": 593600,
      "text": "那好那你把你1/3啊沉淀的这个时长"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 193,
      "start_ms": 593600,
      "end_ms": 596959,
      "text": "比如说有100个远程会员"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 194,
      "start_ms": 597600,
      "end_ms": 598460,
      "text": "明白吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 195,
      "start_ms": 598460,
      "end_ms": 600860,
      "text": "他这个一年下来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 196,
      "start_ms": 600860,
      "end_ms": 603520,
      "text": "那就是100个月啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 197,
      "start_ms": 603520,
      "end_ms": 605120,
      "text": "一年下来那不是说错了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 198,
      "start_ms": 605120,
      "end_ms": 608280,
      "text": "就是嗯1200个月"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 199,
      "start_ms": 609280,
      "end_ms": 610870,
      "text": "1200个月"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 200,
      "start_ms": 610870,
      "end_ms": 613350,
      "text": "然后除以三三分之一嘛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 201,
      "start_ms": 613350,
      "end_ms": 615010,
      "text": "1/3时长啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 202,
      "start_ms": 615010,
      "end_ms": 616430,
      "text": "乘以1/3"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 203,
      "start_ms": 616430,
      "end_ms": 618470,
      "text": "也就400个月"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 204,
      "start_ms": 619820,
      "end_ms": 620820,
      "text": "400个月的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 205,
      "start_ms": 620820,
      "end_ms": 622140,
      "text": "那相当于几张年卡啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 206,
      "start_ms": 622140,
      "end_ms": 624100,
      "text": "对不对啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 207,
      "start_ms": 624100,
      "end_ms": 627820,
      "text": "相当于好多张年卡"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 208,
      "start_ms": 629920,
      "end_ms": 631700,
      "text": "啊30多张年卡"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 209,
      "start_ms": 631700,
      "end_ms": 633920,
      "text": "那么在这种情况啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 210,
      "start_ms": 633920,
      "end_ms": 635520,
      "text": "我是不是33.3张啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 211,
      "start_ms": 635520,
      "end_ms": 637480,
      "text": "30多张年卡"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 212,
      "start_ms": 638199,
      "end_ms": 642199,
      "text": "他如果这100个人有1/10说"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 213,
      "start_ms": 642199,
      "end_ms": 643279,
      "text": "我愿意把这个捐出来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 214,
      "start_ms": 643279,
      "end_ms": 646790,
      "text": "那就是有三张年卡啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 215,
      "start_ms": 646790,
      "end_ms": 650330,
      "text": "或者说是有这40张四张月卡啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 216,
      "start_ms": 650330,
      "end_ms": 652270,
      "text": "有40张月卡"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 217,
      "start_ms": 653380,
      "end_ms": 659300,
      "text": "它可以帮助啊40个月次的失能的就是挂逼啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 218,
      "start_ms": 659300,
      "end_ms": 659860,
      "text": "不叫挂逼了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 219,
      "start_ms": 659860,
      "end_ms": 663780,
      "text": "反正就是他就是状态不太好啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 220,
      "start_ms": 663780,
      "end_ms": 665620,
      "text": "那么我们说了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 221,
      "start_ms": 665620,
      "end_ms": 668080,
      "text": "只如果是这个六个月以上的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 222,
      "start_ms": 668080,
      "end_ms": 669360,
      "text": "他甚至是包住的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 223,
      "start_ms": 669360,
      "end_ms": 671109,
      "text": "六个月以上"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 224,
      "start_ms": 671109,
      "end_ms": 675530,
      "text": "甚至是有这个二人间的这个包住的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 225,
      "start_ms": 675530,
      "end_ms": 676870,
      "text": "就这么一个机制"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 226,
      "start_ms": 676870,
      "end_ms": 679530,
      "text": "那这个机制的话就是说什么样的人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 227,
      "start_ms": 679530,
      "end_ms": 681410,
      "text": "人选是由这里推举的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 228,
      "start_ms": 681410,
      "end_ms": 684680,
      "text": "他有一个重要的裁量权啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 229,
      "start_ms": 684680,
      "end_ms": 685760,
      "text": "有个重要的材料权"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 230,
      "start_ms": 688680,
      "end_ms": 695150,
      "text": "然后这个所以这个哦然后还有就是啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 231,
      "start_ms": 695150,
      "end_ms": 696590,
      "text": "什么样的失能者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 232,
      "start_ms": 696590,
      "end_ms": 697950,
      "text": "他已经说判明了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 233,
      "start_ms": 697950,
      "end_ms": 699070,
      "text": "他现在不失能了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 234,
      "start_ms": 699070,
      "end_ms": 699870,
      "text": "他找到工作了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 235,
      "start_ms": 699870,
      "end_ms": 701210,
      "text": "而且他怎么有手有脚"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 236,
      "start_ms": 701210,
      "end_ms": 702870,
      "text": "不能游手好闲的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 237,
      "start_ms": 702870,
      "end_ms": 704130,
      "text": "那么让他把"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 238,
      "start_ms": 704130,
      "end_ms": 707390,
      "text": "让他可以接受这种啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 239,
      "start_ms": 707390,
      "end_ms": 712230,
      "text": "长期的这个生活保障的这个资格给他撤除掉"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 240,
      "start_ms": 712230,
      "end_ms": 715309,
      "text": "也是由他来决定的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 241,
      "start_ms": 715309,
      "end_ms": 716589,
      "text": "也是由他来决定的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 242,
      "start_ms": 716589,
      "end_ms": 718489,
      "text": "所以他具有这种权利啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 243,
      "start_ms": 718489,
      "end_ms": 720680,
      "text": "他具有这种权利实质性的权利"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 244,
      "start_ms": 720680,
      "end_ms": 726560,
      "text": "他会每一个月能够去推荐这个类似这种名单啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 245,
      "start_ms": 727120,
      "end_ms": 729220,
      "text": "包括是他自己的朋友啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 246,
      "start_ms": 729220,
      "end_ms": 732900,
      "text": "啊这这他组成人员他可能本身不是会员"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 247,
      "start_ms": 732900,
      "end_ms": 735440,
      "text": "简直就是一个普通人啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 248,
      "start_ms": 735440,
      "end_ms": 736740,
      "text": "外围外围的一个人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 249,
      "start_ms": 736740,
      "end_ms": 739040,
      "text": "但是他这个生活遇到困顿了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 250,
      "start_ms": 739040,
      "end_ms": 743800,
      "text": "然后这个就可以经由这个生活委员会"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 251,
      "start_ms": 743800,
      "end_ms": 747350,
      "text": "来向这个想推荐啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 252,
      "start_ms": 747350,
      "end_ms": 750590,
      "text": "那么有这么一些这个生活保障卡的人啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 253,
      "start_ms": 750590,
      "end_ms": 755090,
      "text": "或者说能够除了这个远程会员之外的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 254,
      "start_ms": 755090,
      "end_ms": 758630,
      "text": "还有一个就是说啊再立会员就没有了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 255,
      "start_ms": 758630,
      "end_ms": 760170,
      "text": "再地会员没有了啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 256,
      "start_ms": 760170,
      "end_ms": 761790,
      "text": "再体会员没有在体会员自己在"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 257,
      "start_ms": 761790,
      "end_ms": 766050,
      "text": "就是说每个人来这里吃饭四五顿以上的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 258,
      "start_ms": 766050,
      "end_ms": 767550,
      "text": "我们就不算了啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 259,
      "start_ms": 767550,
      "end_ms": 769010,
      "text": "因为每周都来嘛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 260,
      "start_ms": 769010,
      "end_ms": 773190,
      "text": "是这个如果你是培训部的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 261,
      "start_ms": 773190,
      "end_ms": 774330,
      "text": "你是培训部的学员"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 262,
      "start_ms": 774330,
      "end_ms": 775950,
      "text": "反正你是劳动者工人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 263,
      "start_ms": 776950,
      "end_ms": 779900,
      "text": "劳动者就典型的劳动者工人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 264,
      "start_ms": 779900,
      "end_ms": 782920,
      "text": "然后就是说你交的这个会员费"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 265,
      "start_ms": 782920,
      "end_ms": 784380,
      "text": "生活服务的这个服务费"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 266,
      "start_ms": 784380,
      "end_ms": 789400,
      "text": "也是基本上是一个支持性质的支持性质"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 267,
      "start_ms": 790300,
      "end_ms": 793180,
      "text": "但是呢你和这个远程会员差别在于"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 268,
      "start_ms": 793180,
      "end_ms": 796240,
      "text": "你是在地的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 269,
      "start_ms": 796400,
      "end_ms": 799680,
      "text": "然后是可可能是厂里面就已经包吃住了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 270,
      "start_ms": 799680,
      "end_ms": 802930,
      "text": "场内已经包吃住啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 271,
      "start_ms": 802930,
      "end_ms": 805610,
      "text": "就是一个月也就来四次"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 272,
      "start_ms": 805610,
      "end_ms": 806570,
      "text": "吃四顿饭"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 273,
      "start_ms": 806570,
      "end_ms": 808090,
      "text": "小于四四顿以下"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 274,
      "start_ms": 808090,
      "end_ms": 810040,
      "text": "然后甚至不吃饭就吃过了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 275,
      "start_ms": 810040,
      "end_ms": 812120,
      "text": "那也是具有这个支持性质的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 276,
      "start_ms": 812120,
      "end_ms": 813560,
      "text": "那么在这种情况下呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 277,
      "start_ms": 813560,
      "end_ms": 817800,
      "text": "我们会把他们的盘子是这样来划分"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 278,
      "start_ms": 818080,
      "end_ms": 819580,
      "text": "这是初步建议"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 279,
      "start_ms": 819580,
      "end_ms": 821520,
      "text": "比如说他也交360块"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 280,
      "start_ms": 821520,
      "end_ms": 821880,
      "text": "一个月"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 281,
      "start_ms": 821880,
      "end_ms": 823100,
      "text": "360元1月"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 282,
      "start_ms": 823100,
      "end_ms": 827010,
      "text": "那么初步建议是这360元里面是划三份"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 283,
      "start_ms": 827010,
      "end_ms": 828090,
      "text": "1/3"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 284,
      "start_ms": 828090,
      "end_ms": 830640,
      "text": "三分之一三分之一啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 285,
      "start_ms": 830640,
      "end_ms": 836000,
      "text": "1/3呢是和刚刚那一样的沉淀呢沉淀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 286,
      "start_ms": 836000,
      "end_ms": 839190,
      "text": "然后可分享的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 287,
      "start_ms": 839190,
      "end_ms": 840570,
      "text": "可分享给别人的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 288,
      "start_ms": 840570,
      "end_ms": 842110,
      "text": "但是也是有月份限制"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 289,
      "start_ms": 842110,
      "end_ms": 843070,
      "text": "你在三个月以上"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 290,
      "start_ms": 843070,
      "end_ms": 844550,
      "text": "你沉淀满一个月你才可开"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 291,
      "start_ms": 844550,
      "end_ms": 846559,
      "text": "可开始给别人啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 292,
      "start_ms": 846559,
      "end_ms": 848679,
      "text": "这个是就是生活保障"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 293,
      "start_ms": 848679,
      "end_ms": 851280,
      "text": "生活服务啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 294,
      "start_ms": 851280,
      "end_ms": 852760,
      "text": "生活保障的一个沉淀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 295,
      "start_ms": 852760,
      "end_ms": 856320,
      "text": "但是可以分享三分之13月以上"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 296,
      "start_ms": 857049,
      "end_ms": 862060,
      "text": "那么另外中间的1/3是用来这个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 297,
      "start_ms": 863580,
      "end_ms": 865320,
      "text": "住到另外池子里面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 298,
      "start_ms": 865320,
      "end_ms": 868740,
      "text": "那么是这个培训费的池子里面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 299,
      "start_ms": 870200,
      "end_ms": 872160,
      "text": "啊培训费的池子里面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 300,
      "start_ms": 872160,
      "end_ms": 873840,
      "text": "你交了360块钱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 301,
      "start_ms": 873840,
      "end_ms": 878760,
      "text": "你可以有这个培训费减免减免一个池子啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 302,
      "start_ms": 878760,
      "end_ms": 881020,
      "text": "120块一个月"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 303,
      "start_ms": 881460,
      "end_ms": 884760,
      "text": "你如果说能够连续交满多少个月"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 304,
      "start_ms": 885200,
      "end_ms": 887980,
      "text": "或者说有好多好好多这样的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 305,
      "start_ms": 887980,
      "end_ms": 891760,
      "text": "通过培训项目找到工作出去了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 306,
      "start_ms": 891760,
      "end_ms": 896300,
      "text": "然后要反哺反哺自自己的培训部"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 307,
      "start_ms": 896300,
      "end_ms": 898720,
      "text": "和他的这个生活服务的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 308,
      "start_ms": 898720,
      "end_ms": 900320,
      "text": "他会记这些人呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 309,
      "start_ms": 900320,
      "end_ms": 904190,
      "text": "他会继续充会员或继续购买这个生活服务"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 310,
      "start_ms": 904190,
      "end_ms": 910460,
      "text": "那么呢它里面的1/3的这个呃生活服务费"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 311,
      "start_ms": 910460,
      "end_ms": 913170,
      "text": "就会划到培训费里面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 312,
      "start_ms": 913170,
      "end_ms": 916150,
      "text": "就是一个培训费减免的这个池子里面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 313,
      "start_ms": 916150,
      "end_ms": 919170,
      "text": "去帮助那些呃比较贫苦的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 314,
      "start_ms": 919170,
      "end_ms": 925170,
      "text": "贫困的贫苦而贫困的学员给他们减免培训费"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 315,
      "start_ms": 925170,
      "end_ms": 927890,
      "text": "那么还有1/3就是到店里面去了啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 316,
      "start_ms": 927890,
      "end_ms": 931569,
      "text": "去就是店里面的这个应收账款啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 317,
      "start_ms": 931569,
      "end_ms": 932889,
      "text": "啊电力收走了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 318,
      "start_ms": 934249,
      "end_ms": 937760,
      "text": "就是划着两个三分之一三分之一出来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 319,
      "start_ms": 937760,
      "end_ms": 940980,
      "text": "那么这个就是就是使得这个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 320,
      "start_ms": 940980,
      "end_ms": 943380,
      "text": "这个对于在地会员来讲"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 321,
      "start_ms": 943380,
      "end_ms": 949470,
      "text": "只有参加培训部啊的劳工才有这个权"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 322,
      "start_ms": 949470,
      "end_ms": 950570,
      "text": "这个权利"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 323,
      "start_ms": 950570,
      "end_ms": 953090,
      "text": "一般的在职会员的话就没有"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 324,
      "start_ms": 953090,
      "end_ms": 955210,
      "text": "要么你找到工作啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 325,
      "start_ms": 955210,
      "end_ms": 957529,
      "text": "你这个是啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 326,
      "start_ms": 957529,
      "end_ms": 959989,
      "text": "也不是不一定强求要参加培训部啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 327,
      "start_ms": 959989,
      "end_ms": 962470,
      "text": "就是说你至少你是个啊工作"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 328,
      "start_ms": 962470,
      "end_ms": 964290,
      "text": "反正由这个劳动者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 329,
      "start_ms": 964290,
      "end_ms": 967110,
      "text": "这些劳动者他们就可以去决定"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 330,
      "start_ms": 967110,
      "end_ms": 968330,
      "text": "这些劳动者呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 331,
      "start_ms": 968330,
      "end_ms": 971010,
      "text": "他们这1/3人抽出来哦"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 332,
      "start_ms": 971010,
      "end_ms": 971610,
      "text": "不是2/3"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 333,
      "start_ms": 971610,
      "end_ms": 973090,
      "text": "是40%的人抽出来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 334,
      "start_ms": 973090,
      "end_ms": 977370,
      "text": "他们可以决定哪些人可以享受培训费减免"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 335,
      "start_ms": 978090,
      "end_ms": 980650,
      "text": "他们可以去领选哪些学员"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 336,
      "start_ms": 980650,
      "end_ms": 982130,
      "text": "他确实家里面比较穷的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 337,
      "start_ms": 982130,
      "end_ms": 984410,
      "text": "那么机制是啊机"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 338,
      "start_ms": 984410,
      "end_ms": 986770,
      "text": "那不就培训培训部的学员"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 339,
      "start_ms": 986770,
      "end_ms": 989569,
      "text": "和这个这边的这个生活委员"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 340,
      "start_ms": 989569,
      "end_ms": 992400,
      "text": "生活委员会没有特别的观点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 341,
      "start_ms": 992400,
      "end_ms": 994340,
      "text": "他是通过培训项目来的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 342,
      "start_ms": 994340,
      "end_ms": 996160,
      "text": "他不是充会员过来的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 343,
      "start_ms": 996160,
      "end_ms": 998569,
      "text": "不是冲冲这个生活服务来的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 344,
      "start_ms": 998569,
      "end_ms": 1001669,
      "text": "那么总体的方案就是这样去设计的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 345,
      "start_ms": 1001669,
      "end_ms": 1004900,
      "text": "然后是嗯是我提出的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 346,
      "start_ms": 1004900,
      "end_ms": 1006840,
      "text": "然后我们团队去给他额"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 347,
      "start_ms": 1006840,
      "end_ms": 1008220,
      "text": "稍微就是不是稍微"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 348,
      "start_ms": 1008220,
      "end_ms": 1010420,
      "text": "反正就是比较详细细致的体系化的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 349,
      "start_ms": 1010420,
      "end_ms": 1011300,
      "text": "我们就探讨了一下"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 350,
      "start_ms": 1011300,
      "end_ms": 1013410,
      "text": "然后差差不多是这个草案"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 351,
      "start_ms": 1013650,
      "end_ms": 1016770,
      "text": "那么这个草案的话就是我说的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 352,
      "start_ms": 1016770,
      "end_ms": 1018450,
      "text": "我们重要是互保性啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 353,
      "start_ms": 1018450,
      "end_ms": 1019650,
      "text": "互保性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 354,
      "start_ms": 1019650,
      "end_ms": 1021620,
      "text": "兜底保障"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 355,
      "start_ms": 1021620,
      "end_ms": 1022860,
      "text": "兜底保障"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 356,
      "start_ms": 1022860,
      "end_ms": 1023220,
      "text": "兜底"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 357,
      "start_ms": 1023220,
      "end_ms": 1024700,
      "text": "保障性质"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 358,
      "start_ms": 1026220,
      "end_ms": 1032040,
      "text": "那么在制度上把这个啊他的互保性给他落实"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 359,
      "start_ms": 1034540,
      "end_ms": 1035740,
      "text": "制度上把它落实"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 360,
      "start_ms": 1037540,
      "end_ms": 1039520,
      "text": "然后这个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 361,
      "start_ms": 1041319,
      "end_ms": 1046440,
      "text": "啊很多实质侵害侵害我们的利益的人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 362,
      "start_ms": 1046440,
      "end_ms": 1050110,
      "text": "就可以名正言顺的把这些人给踢掉了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 363,
      "start_ms": 1054660,
      "end_ms": 1055520,
      "text": "好吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 364,
      "start_ms": 1055520,
      "end_ms": 1061750,
      "text": "那么这个是凡是我们体系下的执行生活服务"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 365,
      "start_ms": 1061750,
      "end_ms": 1063910,
      "text": "都是采取这么一个标准"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 366,
      "start_ms": 1068840,
      "end_ms": 1070700,
      "text": "他不是提供互助的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 367,
      "start_ms": 1070700,
      "end_ms": 1073260,
      "text": "不是那种毛毛雨相濡以沫那东西的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 368,
      "start_ms": 1073260,
      "end_ms": 1076129,
      "text": "它是提供互保的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 369,
      "start_ms": 1076129,
      "end_ms": 1083030,
      "text": "就是这是一个比较啊高的要求高的标准好吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 370,
      "start_ms": 1083870,
      "end_ms": 1089170,
      "text": "哎那就呃首先会从这个苏州本部开始去执行"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 371,
      "start_ms": 1089170,
      "end_ms": 1094120,
      "text": "然后那个广州那边有广州徐州啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 372,
      "start_ms": 1094120,
      "end_ms": 1095780,
      "text": "反正是我们直接控制的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 373,
      "start_ms": 1095780,
      "end_ms": 1097770,
      "text": "都是这样去实行啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 374,
      "start_ms": 1097770,
      "end_ms": 1099930,
      "text": "但是它有一个有个过渡啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 375,
      "start_ms": 1099930,
      "end_ms": 1101170,
      "text": "稍微要过渡一下"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 376,
      "start_ms": 1101170,
      "end_ms": 1104090,
      "text": "而且这里面的比例也还要再按照"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 377,
      "start_ms": 1104090,
      "end_ms": 1106899,
      "text": "这个大概是这个比例"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 378,
      "start_ms": 1106899,
      "end_ms": 1108419,
      "text": "因为这好计算啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 379,
      "start_ms": 1108419,
      "end_ms": 1112340,
      "text": "一比一比的嗯"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 380,
      "start_ms": 1112340,
      "end_ms": 1113540,
      "text": "困好吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 381,
      "start_ms": 1113540,
      "end_ms": 1114560,
      "text": "那就讲到这里了"
